    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Gunnar Henderson** pacing the offense as our premier start at an 81.87 efficiency score. His matchup against Arrighetti is our most favorable deployment, bolstered by a +16% boost from the SP\u2019s skill metrics and a strong platoon advantage. Similarly, **Jackson Merrill** (75.26) and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.66) are locked in as elite options, with both benefiting significantly from favorable park factors and high-leverage spots in their respective lineups. **Jacob Wilson** (71.63) also presents a strong play, as the matchup against Littell allows him to capitalize on his +19% SP skill advantage. While **Heliot Ramos** (44.19), **Andy Pages** (51.65), and **Kyle Tucker** (55.62) are currently projected as more marginal starts, their inclusion remains dependent on confirming their expected lineup positions to ensure we maintain our daily efficiency floor.\n\nOur most difficult bench decision involved **Nasim Nunez**, who finished just outside the starting nine with a 58.79 score. Despite the potential for stolen bases, his projected role at the bottom of the order (-8% penalty) ultimately relegated him behind the higher-scoring profiles of **Curtis Mead** and **Miguel Vargas**. We are closely monitoring the lineup statuses for **Curtis Mead**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Gunnar Henderson**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Andy Pages**, **Kyle Tucker**, and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**; should any of these players move down the order or face unexpected defensive substitutions, we are prepared to pivot to the bench. While **Miguel Vargas** and **Sam Antonacci** face the elite threat of Bieber, their individual efficiency scores remain elevated due to their high xwOBA projections, giving them the green light to remain in our active lineup.",
